                  "display": "Summarization of encounter note"
                }
              ]
            },
            "title": "Synthesis"
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">Dear Colleague, I am writing to inform you about the recent hospital admission of your 88-year-old female patient. She was admitted on 16/03/2026 due to an acute exacerbation of her known chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD). On admission, she presented with increased dyspnoea, productive cough, and reduced oxygen saturation. Diagnostic workup included chest X-ray, arterial blood gas analysis, pulse oximetry, and blood tests, confirming an acute exacerbation without evidence of pneumonia or cardiac decompensation. She was treated with nebulised bronchodilators, systemic corticosteroids, supplemental oxygen therapy, and supportive intravenous fluids. She responded well to treatment with significant clinical improvement. She was discharged on 17/03/2026 with oral prednisolone taper and optimised inhaler regimen. Please arrange follow-up in two to four weeks. Do not hesitate to contact me for further information. Kind regards, Dr. [Treating Physician]</div>"
            },
